{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10643040","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10643040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1064304001:0":{"text":"드르렁... 쿨...","source_cn":"呼……呼……呼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x161F8FE35A83F4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064304002:0":{"text":"새벽녘, 요란한 폭발음이 곤히 잠든 쿠루루를 깨웠다.\n비몽사몽간에 소리가 난 곳을 바라보니, 아까 급하게 닫았던 심연의 통로가 또다시 열려 있었다...","source_cn":"黎明时分，一声巨响吵醒了酣睡的库露露。\\n迷迷糊糊中，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AABDC9FBA023F82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::0":{"text":"군나르가 마법을 부여한 장창","source_cn":"勒图姆附魔的长矛","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6E17695FD42A2BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064304003:0":{"text":"거기서 뛰쳐나온 군나르는 거친 형상에 위험한 기운을 내뿜는 마법 장창 한 자루를 등에 메고 있었다.","source_cn":"勒图姆从中跃出，他的背部，携着一把造型狂野、散发着危险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF92DC20763E18BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064304004:0":{"text":"냉병기 마법 부여, 완료.","source_cn":"冷兵器附魔，完毕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB441E3563FC3AEBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064304005:0":{"text":"화력 실험, 성공.\n첨단 구조.","source_cn":"火力实验，成功。\\n尖端构造。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x216A67BCDDB50C68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064304006:1":{"text":"와일드.\n충격적인 제압력!","source_cn":"狂野。\\n震撼压制！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04CC7EFA86A634C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064304007:0":{"text":"하암... 어... 어... 어어?!","source_cn":"哈欠——嗯……嗯……嗯？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C80FE91FDD1A228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064304008:0":{"text":"너, 너! 돌아올 생각은 있었어? 네가 무슨 짓을 저질렀는지 알아?!","source_cn":"你——你你你还知道回来，你知不知道你干了什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7277D719327541C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064304009:1":{"text":"그렇게 문만 열어 놓고 뚫린 구멍을 나한테 떠넘긴 채로 도망가 버리다니! 내가 그걸 틀어막느라 얼마나 고생했는지 알기나 해!","source_cn":"居然就那样开个门跑掉了！留下个破洞给我！你知道我费了多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AF019D0891F0341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064304010:1":{"text":"만약 그 구멍에서 이상한 것들이 튀어나와서... 이쪽 사람이며 풀이며 나무며 전부 기괴한 모습으로 변하기라도 하면 어쩌려고?!","source_cn":"万一那个破洞里出来什么乱七八糟的东西……导致这边的人啊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E6E66A358BD37EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064304011:1":{"text":"그래! 쿠루루 님께서 걱정하시느라 밤새 제대로 쉬지도 못하셨다! 그러니 쿠루루 님, 이런 짓을 벌인 원흉은 확실히 처리하는 게 옳습니다요!","source_cn":"没错！库露露大人忧心忡忡，一整晚都没有休息好！始作俑者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC56C2738F3DF16E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064304012:0":{"text":"재앙 초래.\n무슨 문제라도?","source_cn":"引发灾厄。\\n又如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDA77E4E3A4B50A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064304013:0":{"text":"으아아... 너, 너어...","source_cn":"哇哇，你、你你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC29D7E48869A6609","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064304014:0":{"text":"쿠루루가 화가 나 말문까지 막힌 그때, 군나르는 무언가 떠올랐는지 말을 바꾸었다...","source_cn":"就在库露露生气得说不出话时，勒图姆似乎想到了什么，转而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58215020E345F5BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064304015:0":{"text":"제작 대회 중, 심연, 오염을 일으킬 위험.\